  "description": "C# library for communicating with, controlling and programming model railway (railroad) trains, points (turnouts), signals and other accessories via the LocoNet® protocol. Compatible with command stations via USB, TCP/IP or UDP. Targets .Net Standard 2.0 for compatability with .Net Framework, .Net Core and .Net 6. Based on .Net Core port of Loconet® Toolbox by Chris Sharp, Modelspoorgroep Venlo and Ewout Prangsma.",
